:"1f9c962e02107c042c4f8369c564114c82ba95ea02278b9eb7a5ffa9715fd304","session_date":"2023-10-08","session_datetime":"2023-10-08T15:13:00","session_id":"session_22","session_index":22,"source_sha256":"ed75d8320d1810b91785f6741a2569dce13bf4b713e834e9504a2868e8d44d53","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":7},{"dia_id":"D25:7","global_turn_index":431,"locator":"[S25T7]","raw_turn_sha256":"bc35fd3c26b8239658758970b10574109957855881342b8232d6d1483573874f","rendered_turn_sha256":"d696d91fa1e23d32f296c817ed4eb5d788f2bf364dcec598fbb6c83de904e0b8","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"ed831046d2af0d43672203bcd697cf69661fd55e4b488794826838f7ab6ed64b","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":7}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-09-15, told Calvin (answering whether it's satisfying to see his hard work pay off, on the restoration finished that day — context in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)) that \"It's so satisfying to see this brought back to life,\" especially seeing people's reactions when they see the finished product — \"makes all the hard work worth it\" [S19T9].\n- On 2023-10-04, said he loves being able to transform something old and beat-up into something beautiful, and that it's the small successes that make him feel proud and fulfilled (said to Calvin right after Calvin praised his grease-stained hands — \"Those hands show you worked hard. You put in lots of effort. You should definitely be proud!\" — context in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)) [S21T10].\n- On 2023-10-08, when telling Calvin about his car show and restored/modified car (details in ## Classic cars), said working on cars \"is not just a hobby, it's a passion\" — it's \"like therapy, a way to get away from everyday stress\"; as a kid he'd spend hours in his dad's garage, tinkering with engines — \"it was like my own sanctuary\" (echoing his childhood memories of working on cars with his dad, see above); now he's \"lucky enough to do this as a job, to take something broken and make it into something awesome\" [S22T5].\n- On 2023-10-08, said doing what he loves has been \"my goal since I was a kid\" and it's awesome that he's able to do it; restoring things can be tough but \"the feeling of accomplishment it gives is great\"; Calvin responded that bringing broken things back to life is \"so satisfying,\" that working on cars \"can be a real escape from reality\" (he understands the feeling), and that \"doing what you love for a living, that's the ultimate goal,\" adding \"Keep going with it, it's really inspiring.\" [S22T5][S22T6][S22T7].\n- On 2023-10-23, told Calvin he recently had a good conversation with some neighbors about current events and politics — it was nice to hear different perspectives and share their own; he finds that interacting like that cheers him up and helps him stay informed (conversation flow in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships; Calvin's response in the Music and Relationships sections of /memories/calvin.md) [S25T7].","text_sha256":"c1014811b2e3c0d070071c4df5e34bb651ff9c83b522639ab196d9268ec10c45","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D7:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":73,"line_start":73,"source_locators":["[S7T4]"],"text_sha256":"8c286f2268037f8757f049002b3c88b47c65d6c05a828c4c1cc8a13476af1edb"},{"dia_ids":["D7:6"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":74,"line_start":74,"source_locators":["[S7T6]"],"text_sha256":"1b9059d1f79fe193197af2d88cca5b0944bf26cbd423fa34cf32d2db0e857769"},{"dia_ids":["D7:6"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":75,"line_start":75,"source_locators":["[S7T6]"],"text_sha256":"cea74ab279d3185be18829ac14563c97a010f22efbcf6efae6badf819fc59039"},{"dia_ids":["D7:7","D7:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":76,"line_start":76,"source_l